  "description": "YITAMOTOR is one of the largest automotive running boards and vehicle accessory retailers in the United States. We take pride in our quality control in assuring that we provide only the highest-quality running boards and auto accessories to our customers.\nFitment\n2004-2024 Nissan Titan Crew Cab\n2016-2024 Nissan Titan XD Crew Cab\nFeatures\nIMPORTANT - Only\nfit 2004-2024 Nissan Titan Crew Cab (Excludes 2016 Models) &\n2016-2024 Titan XD Crew Cab; If you’re not sure what model you have,\nplease check the cab size picture.\nPRACTICAL DESIGN - 6.5\" wide stylish black stainless steel pad provides\na textured surface for excellent footing. Each side can support up to\n450 lb.\nSUPER QUALITY - The running boards' structure provides strength and\ndurability. The 6.5-inch non-slip injection step pad allows easy\nmovement such as stepping in, stepping out, and even jumping (450 lb.\ncapacity)\nSUPREME FUNCTIONALITY - Made from Stainless Steel and pre-treated with\nrust-resistant powder coatings. One-piece design ensures excellent\nperformance and looks for years to come\nEASY TO INSTALL - Easy bolt-on installation with no drilling required.\nAll factory holes are perfectly aligned with the mounts; bolts to\nfactory mount in less than an hour\nProfessional installation recommended",
